msgstr "Semillas para una hortaliza naranja asquerosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING"
