msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "That thing looks terrible."
msgstr "Tiene un aspecto terrible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD"
msgid "Great, now we've irritated some marble crime boss!"
msgstr "¡Estupendo, ahora hemos irritado a un villano de mármol!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED"
msgid "Looks like a bunch of rubble to me."
msgstr "Me parece solo un montón de escombros."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "I'm more used to destroying things than fixing them."
msgstr "Estoy más acostumbrada a destruir cosas que a arreglarlas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY"
msgid "Ew! It's wriggling!"
msgstr "¡Puaj! ¡Está retorciéndose!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "What a creepy load of junk!"
msgstr "¡Qué montón de chatarra tan asqueroso!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE"
msgid "Ha, falling to pieces. Rookie mistake."
msgstr "Ja, se está cayendo a pedazos. Un error de novato."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEEDS"
msgid "Farming is boring."
msgstr "Sembrar es aburrido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED"
msgid "No good for farming now."
msgstr "No muy buenas para plantarlas ahora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD"
msgid "Pfft. It'll burn like the rest."
msgstr "Pfff. Arderá como el resto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT"
msgid "But destruction is so much more fun!"
msgstr "¡Pero la destrucción es mucho más divertida!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE"
msgid "At least something around here can hold it together."
msgstr "Por lo menos algo de por aquí puede repararse."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER"
msgid "Eww, it's even creepier than the real one."
msgstr "Ahh, da incluso más miedo que el de verdad."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART"
msgid "Oh, ewww! Who would ever touch that?!"
msgstr "¡Oh, qué ascooo! ¿¡Quién tocaría eso!?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL"
msgid "Not great for fighting."
msgstr "No muy útil para pelear."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN"
msgid "Ew! Burn that!"
msgstr "¡Puaj! ¡Quemadla!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT"
msgid "I always set them on fire."
msgstr "Yo siempre las prendo fuego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC"
msgid "They taught us how to make these in Girl Scouts."
msgstr "Nos enseñaron a hacerlas en las Girl Scouts."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SILK"
msgid "Mmmmmm. Smooth."
msgstr "Mmmmmm. Qué suave."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKELETON"
msgid "I hope you at least went out in a blaze of glory."
msgstr "Espero que al menos hayas ardido de forma gloriosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT"
msgid "I've got a headache just looking at it."
msgstr "Me da dolor de cabeza solo con mirarlo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.DEFAULT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.DEFAULT"
msgid "The fire of %s's life was extinguished by %s."
msgstr "El fuego de la vida de %s ha sido extinguido por %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.FEMALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.FEMALE"
msgid "The fire of %s's life was extinguished by %s."
msgstr "El fuego de la vida de %s ha sido extinguido por %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.MALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.MALE"
msgid "The fire of %s's life was extinguished by %s."
msgstr "El fuego de la vida de %s ha sido extinguido por %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.ROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.ROBOT"
msgid "The fire of %s's life was extinguished by %s."
msgstr "El fuego de la vida de %s ha sido extinguido por %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKETCH"
msgid "Trading diagrams is for dorks."
msgstr "Los diagramas de comercio son para idiotas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKULLCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SKULLCHEST"
msgid "Ooooh, spooky!"
msgstr "¡Ooooh, espeluznante!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLEEPBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLEEPBOMB"
msgid "Who's ready for a nap!"
msgstr "¿Quién está listo para una siesta?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLURPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLURPER"
msgid "Do they have little fires in their bellies?"
msgstr "¿Tienen pequeñas llamas en sus estómagos?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT"
msgid "Eeewwwww, it's still alive!"
msgstr "¡Qué ascooo, aún está vivo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT"
msgid "Eeewwwww, it's still alive!"
msgstr "¡Qué ascooo, aún está vivo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE"
msgid "I want to blow it up!"
msgstr "¡Quiero hacerla volar por los aires!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT"
msgid "It's perfectly head-shaped."
msgstr "Tiene una forma de cabeza perfecta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE"
msgid "I should burn them out."
msgstr "Debería quemarlos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME"
msgid "I love this stuff!"
msgstr "¡Me encanta esta cosa!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES"
msgid "Heh. It broke."
msgstr "Je. Se ha roto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "Not quite a phoenix, but still cute. I guess."
msgstr "No es un ave fénix, pero aun así es bonito, supongo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "Are you hungry?"
msgstr "¿Tienes hambre?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "Okay, okay! I get it, you're hungry."
msgstr "¡Vale, vale! Lo pillo, tienes hambre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT"
msgid "This could be made better with FIRE!"
msgstr "¡Esto se puede mejorar con FUEGO!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED"
