msgstr "Por lo menos todavía es inflamable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "It's like floating fire!"
msgstr "¡Es como fuego flotante!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD"
msgid "It feels flammable."
msgstr "Parece inflamable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "It has no idea where it's going."
msgstr "No sabe dónde va."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD"
msgid "It feels flammable."
msgstr "Parece inflamable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "It's like colorful sparks!"
msgstr "¡Son como chispas de colores!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD"
msgid "It feels flammable."
msgstr "Parece inflamable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT"
msgid "Boo! Hissss!"
msgstr "¡Buuu! ¡Fssss!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT"
msgid "It's so beautiful!"
msgstr "¡Es muy bonito!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO"
msgid "Always whirling! Swirling towards destruction!"
msgstr "¡Siempre girando! ¡Girando hacia la destrucción!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE"
msgid "Gross! I told you we shoulda burned it!"
msgstr "¡Qué asco! ¡Te dije que deberíamos haberlo quemado!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING"
msgid "What's a weird table doing out here? Let's burn it!"
msgstr "¿Qué hace una mesa tan rara aquí? ¡Hay que quemarla!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE"
msgid "Rocks are boring."
msgstr "Las rocas son aburridas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL"
msgid "More boring rocks."
msgstr "Más rocas aburridas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STALKER"
msgid "I brought you back so I could beat you up!"
msgstr "¡Te he traído de vuelta para que pueda derrotarte!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM"
msgid "It's just bones and shadow."
msgstr "Son solo huesos y sombras."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION"
msgid "Yuck, it's barely even alive."
msgstr "Qué asco, apenas está vivo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY"
msgid "Looks about the same."
msgstr "Parece estar igual."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "Is that supposed to be something?"
msgstr "¿Se supone que esto es algo?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP"
msgid "Such a nice statue. Shame if something were to happen to it."
msgstr "Qué estatua tan bonita. Sería una pena si algo le sucediera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL"
msgid "A big stone nerd."
msgstr "Un friki grande de piedra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's an okay statue, I guess."
msgstr "Es una estatua buena, supongo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1"
msgid "Yikes. I'd cover that up too if I were her."
msgstr "Uy. Yo también me cubriría si fuera ella."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2"
msgid "She hasn't put her face on for the day yet."
msgstr "Aún no ha puesto su mejor cara para el día."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3"
msgid "A brazier would be nicer."
msgstr "Un brasero estaría mejor."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL"
msgid "Make a spark, it'll still burn."
msgstr "Haré una chispa, aún podría arder."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STINGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STINGER"
msgid "It's pokey!"
msgstr "¡Es puntiagudo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT"
msgid "A hat made of straw. To think, it could've been tinder."
msgstr "Un sombrero de paja. Y pensar que podría haber sido yesca."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT"
