#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH"
msgid "That doesn't seem smart."
msgstr "No parece muy inteligente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM"
msgid "That doesn't look like a magic rock to me."
msgstr "A mí no me parece una piedra mágica."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE"
msgid "I'd prefer wood, personally."
msgstr "Personalmente prefiero la madera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF"
msgid "Nah. Something long and thin goes there, but not this."
msgstr "No. Ahí va algo largo y delgado, pero esto no."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER"
msgid "I'll wait until the danger's passed."
msgstr "Esperaré hasta que pase el peligro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY"
msgid "Could use a cleaning first."
msgstr "Le vendría bien una limpieza primero."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE"
msgid "Can't do that now. It'll be dark soon."
msgstr "Ahora no puedo hacer eso. Pronto oscurecerá."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's sleeping."
msgstr "Está durmiendo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL"
