msgstr "Probablemente deba usar lo que hay ahí primero."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGGEM"
