msgstr "No creo que esa funcione aquí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGSHADOWFORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGSHADOWFORM"
