#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_suspenders_yellow_flax
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_suspenders_yellow_flax"
msgid "Wearing this 'follicle yellow' colored shirt makes you feel like the cat's pajamas."
msgstr "Llevar esta camisa de color \"amarillo folículo\" te hace sentir como los pijamas del gato."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_sweatervest_blue_snowbird
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_sweatervest_blue_snowbird"
msgid "An 'electrolytic blue' colored vest made of the finest beefalo wool. Unfortunately, it's not actually warm."
msgstr "Un chaleco de color \"azul electrolítico\" hecho con la más fina lana de beefalo. Por desgracia, no calienta mucho."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_sweatervest_brown_beaver
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_sweatervest_brown_beaver"
msgid "A 'werebeaver brown' colored vest made of the finest beefalo wool. Unfortunately, it's not actually warm."
msgstr "Un chaleco de color \"marrón hombre castor\" hecho con la más fina lana de beefalo. Por desgracia, no calienta mucho."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_sweatervest_green_forest
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_sweatervest_green_forest"
msgid "A 'forest guardian green' colored vest made of the finest beefalo wool. Unfortunately, it's not actually warm."
msgstr "Un chaleco de color \"verde guardabosques\" hecho con la más fina lana de beefalo. Por desgracia, no calienta mucho."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_sweatervest_grey_silver
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_sweatervest_grey_silver"
msgid "A 'cumulus gray' colored vest made of the finest beefalo wool. Unfortunately, it's not actually warm."
msgstr "Un chaleco de color \"gris cúmulos\" hecho con la más fina lana de beefalo. Por desgracia, no calienta mucho."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_sweatervest_red_firehound
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_sweatervest_red_firehound"
msgid "A 'firehound red' colored vest made of the finest beefalo wool. Unfortunately, it's not actually warm."
msgstr "Un chaleco de color \"rojo sabueso de fuego\" hecho con la más fina lana de beefalo. Por desgracia, no calienta mucho."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_tanktop_tiecollar_yellow_goldenrod
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_tanktop_tiecollar_yellow_goldenrod"
msgid "This 'downright neighborly yellow' top just screams \"springtime\"! Seriously. Please make it stop screaming."
msgstr "¡Esta camiseta de color \"amarillo buena vecindad\" va gritando \"primavera\"! En serio. Por favor, haz que deje de gritar."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_toga_white_pure
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_toga_white_pure"
msgid "As they say, \"when in Rome\"!"
msgstr "Como suelen decir, \"todos los caminos llevan a Roma\"."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_trenchcoat_brown_fawn
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_trenchcoat_brown_fawn"
msgid "A fashionable but unprotective trench coat in a 'werebeaver brown' color."
msgstr "Una gabardina moderna pero poco protectora de color \"marrón hombre castor\"."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_trenchcoat_yellow_straw
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_trenchcoat_yellow_straw"
msgid "A fashionable but unprotective trench coat in a 'sulfuric yellow' color."
msgstr "Una gabardina moderna pero poco protectora de color \"amarillo sulfúrico\"."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_trimmed_blouse_red_higgsbury
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_trimmed_blouse_red_higgsbury"
msgid "Get your glad rags on with this 'Higgsbury red' colored shirt."
msgstr "Lleva tus harapos con alegría con esta camisa de color \"rojo Higgsbury\"."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_trimmed_blouse_white_pure
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_trimmed_blouse_white_pure"
msgid "Get your glad rags on with this 'pure white' colored shirt."
msgstr "Lleva tus harapos con alegría con esta camisa de color \"blanco puro\"."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_trimmed_blouse_yellow_flax
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_trimmed_blouse_yellow_flax"
msgid "Get your glad rags on with this 'follicle yellow' colored shirt."
msgstr "Lleva tus harapos con alegría con esta camisa de color \"amarillo folículo\"."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_tshirt_grey_battleship
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_tshirt_grey_battleship"
msgid "A 'cumulus gray' colored shirt. Wilson is working on a W-shirt, but this prototype came out more T-shaped."
msgstr "Una camiseta de color \"gris cúmulos\". Wilson está trabajando para hacer una camisa, pero este prototipo le ha salido más bien una camiseta."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_tshirt_purple_mauve
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_tshirt_purple_mauve"
msgid "A 'snail mucus purple' colored shirt. Wilson is working on a W-shirt, but this prototype came out more T-shaped."
msgstr "Una camiseta de color \"morado mucosidad de caracol\". Wilson está trabajando para hacer una camisa, pero este prototipo le ha salido más bien una camiseta."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_tshirt_red_higgsbury
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_tshirt_red_higgsbury"
msgid "A 'Higgsbury red' colored shirt. Wilson is working on a W-shirt, but this prototype came out more T-shaped."
msgstr "Una camiseta de color \"rojo Higgsbury\". Wilson está trabajando para hacer una camisa, pero este prototipo le ha salido más bien una camiseta."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_tshirt_white_smoke
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_tshirt_white_smoke"
msgid "A 'smoke white' colored shirt. Wilson is working on a W-shirt, but this prototype came out more T-shaped."
msgstr "Una camiseta de color \"blanco humo\". Wilson está trabajando para hacer una camisa, pero este prototipo le ha salido más bien una camiseta."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_tweedvest_blue_lightning
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_tweedvest_blue_lightning"
msgid "Don't get lost in the tweeds wearing this 'lightning goat blue' colored souvenir from the Village of Tweed."
msgstr "No te pierdas entre el tweed llevando este souvenir de color \"azul cabra eléctrica\" de la Aldea de Tweed."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_tweedvest_brown_chocolate
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_tweedvest_brown_chocolate"
msgid "Don't get lost in the tweeds wearing this 'insufficient chocolate brown' colored souvenir from the Village of Tweed."
msgstr "No te pierdas entre el tweed llevando este souvenir de color \"marrón chocolate insuficiente\" de la Aldea de Tweed."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_tweedvest_green_hunters
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_tweedvest_green_hunters"
msgid "Don't get lost in the tweeds wearing this 'forest guardian green' colored souvenir from the Village of Tweed."
msgstr "No te pierdas entre el tweed llevando este souvenir de color \"verde guardabosques\" de la Aldea de Tweed."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_tweedvest_grey_steel
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_tweedvest_grey_steel"
msgid "Don't get lost in the tweeds wearing this 'colloidal silver gray' colored souvenir from the Village of Tweed."
msgstr "No te pierdas entre el tweed llevando este souvenir de color \"gris plata coloidal\" de la Aldea de Tweed."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_tweedvest_tan_grass
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_tweedvest_tan_grass"
msgid "Don't get lost in the tweeds wearing this 'dry grass tan' colored souvenir from the Village of Tweed."
msgstr "No te pierdas entre el tweed llevando este souvenir de color \"bronceado hierba seca\" de la Aldea de Tweed."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wathgrithr_deerclops
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wathgrithr_deerclops"
msgid "Look like an intimidating Deerclops with this Hallowed Nights costume."
msgstr "Vístete como un ciérclope intimidante con este traje de Hallowed."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wathgrithr_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wathgrithr_formal"
msgid "Be a knight in shining armor. Or at least look like one. (It's just a costume, not real armor.)"
msgstr "Sé un caballero en una brillante armadura. O al menos parécelo. (Es solo un traje, no una armadura de verdad)."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wathgrithr_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wathgrithr_gladiator"
msgid "This decorative battle armor is sure to strike fear into the foes of the Valkyrie."
msgstr "Esta armadura de batalla decorativa infunde el terror en los enemigos de la valquiria."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wathgrithr_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wathgrithr_magma"
msgid "Shroud yourself with the burning fires of Ragnarok."
msgstr "Envuélvete con los fuegos ardientes del Ragnarok."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wathgrithr_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wathgrithr_nature"
msgid "The folds of this fabric sway in the breeze, reminding the wearer of leaves on the wind."
msgstr "Los pliegues de este tejido se agitan en la brisa, recordando al usuario las hojas en el viento."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wathgrithr_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wathgrithr_rose"
msgid "The perfect ensemble for a Buff Beauty."
msgstr "El conjunto perfecto para una rosa."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wathgrithr_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wathgrithr_shadow"
msgid "Dark armor. It looks nice, but unfortunately shadows have no substance."
msgstr "Una armadura oscura. Parece bonita, pero por desgracia las sombras no tienen sustancia."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wathgrithr_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wathgrithr_survivor"
msgid "This costume looks a little the worse for wear, but the performance must go on."
msgstr "Este traje parece un poco peor por el desgaste, pero el espectáculo debe continuar."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wathgrithr_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wathgrithr_victorian"
msgid "This actress fought tooth and nail for this prestigious Shakespearean role."
msgstr "Esta actriz luchó con uñas y dientes para conseguir este prestigioso papel de Shakespeare."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wathgrithr_wrestler
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wathgrithr_wrestler"
msgid "This bodysuit and sash make for a dynamic look in the ring."
msgstr "Este traje y la banda te dan un aspecto dinámico en el ring."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_waxwell_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_waxwell_formal"
msgid "The delightful aroma of mothballs and decay wafts off it."
msgstr "Desprende un delicioso aroma de naftalina y decadencia."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_waxwell_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_waxwell_gladiator"
msgid "Brew alchemical mixtures in style with this alchemist's robe top."
msgstr "Prepara mezclas alquímicas con esta popular bata superior de alquimista."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_waxwell_krampus
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_waxwell_krampus"
msgid "Dress up as a spooky Krampus for Hallowed Nights."
msgstr "Vístete como un espeluznante Krampus para Hallowed."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_waxwell_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_waxwell_magma"
msgid "Armor that barely contains your fiery anger."
msgstr "Una armadura que apenas contiene tu ira."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_waxwell_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_waxwell_nature"
msgid "The leaves on this tunic never wilt nor die, but neither do they grow."
msgstr "Las hojas de esta túnica nunca se marchitan ni mueren, pero tampoco crecen."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_waxwell_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_waxwell_rose"
msgid "People should know better than to grow too close to you."
msgstr "La gente debería saber que es mejor no crecer demasiado cerca de ti."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_waxwell_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_waxwell_survivor"
msgid "A tragic end to a once-dapper three piece suit."
msgstr "Un trágico final para un traje de tres piezas que en su día fue apuesto."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_waxwell_unshadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_waxwell_unshadow"
msgid "This look hearkens back to a simpler time. You are missed, Charlie."
msgstr "Este aspecto se remonta a una época más simple. Estás perdido, Charlie."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_waxwell_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_waxwell_victorian"
msgid "The extravagant attire of an influential upper cruster."
msgstr "El extravagante atuendo de un influyente aristócrata."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_webber_bat
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_webber_bat"
msgid "Look the part of a spooky Batilisk."
msgstr "Hazte pasar por un muercilisco espeluznante."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_webber_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_webber_formal"
msgid "A black blazer with a red scarf."
msgstr "Un blazer negro con una bufanda roja."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_webber_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_webber_gladiator"
msgid "You don't want to know what spiders do with their prey."
msgstr "En verdad no quieres saber lo que las arañas hacen con sus presas."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_webber_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_webber_ice"
msgid "This fluffy white spider body comes with a warm scarf!"
msgstr "¡Este cuerpo de araña blanco y peludo viene con una bufanda cálida!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_webber_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_webber_magma"
msgid "The flaming skull is just for show."
msgstr "El cráneo en llamas es solo para presumir."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_webber_punk
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_webber_punk"
msgid "Spiderpunk. It's a thing now."
msgstr "Una araña punki. Es lo que se lleva ahora."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_webber_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_webber_rose"
msgid "Wild flowers are just as beautiful as any fancy show rose."
msgstr "Las flores silvestres son tan hermosas como cualquier rosa doméstica."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_webber_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_webber_shadow"
msgid "The hollowed out body of an elegant black widow."
msgstr "El cuerpo ahuecado de una elegante viuda negra."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_webber_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_webber_survivor"
msgid "Spiderwebs are pretty useful for bandaging scrapes."
msgstr "Las telarañas son bastante útiles para vendajes en caso de apuros."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_webber_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_webber_victorian"
msgid "Someone's mother dressed them this morning."
msgstr "La madre de alguien le vistió esta mañana."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wendy_creepy
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wendy_creepy"
msgid "A dress for a supernatural child."
msgstr "Un vestido para un niño sobrenatural."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wendy_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wendy_formal"
msgid "A cute party dress with puffed sleeves."
msgstr "Un bonito vestido de fiesta con mangas abombadas."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wendy_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wendy_gladiator"
msgid "A belt of fangs suits any steadfast fighter."
msgstr "Un cinturón de colmillos que cualquier luchador resuelto puede usar."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wendy_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wendy_ice"
msgid "A lovely dress in which to wander the frozen glades."
msgstr "Un vestido encantador con el que puedes pasearte por los claros congelados."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wendy_lureplant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wendy_lureplant"
msgid "Look the part of an alluring Lureplant."
msgstr "Hazte pasar por un seductor bulbo de carne."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wendy_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wendy_magma"
msgid "A frock of flames to fly like the phoenix."
msgstr "Un vestido de llamas para volar como el ave fénix."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wendy_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wendy_rose"
msgid "The captive rose is bound by the lattice."
msgstr "La rosa cautiva está atada al enrejado."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wendy_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wendy_shadow"
msgid "Finally the darkness envelops you, as you always knew it would."
msgstr "Finalmente la oscuridad te envuelve, como siempre sabías que pasaría."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wendy_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wendy_survivor"
msgid "This skirt has had a close brush with the forces of darkness."
msgstr "Esta falda tiene una lucha cuerpo a cuerpo con las fuerzas de la oscuridad."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wendy_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wendy_victorian"
msgid "No expense has been spared in these grimly beautiful mourning clothes."
msgstr "No se ha incurrido en ningún gasto para confeccionar estas bonitas ropas de luto."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wes_clown
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wes_clown"
msgid "The veneers of a clown."
msgstr "La indumentaria de un payaso."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wes_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wes_formal"
msgid "A fancy flowing shirt with formal trousers."
msgstr "Una camisa elegante con pantalones formales."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wes_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wes_gladiator"
msgid "Stun your enemies into silence."
msgstr "Aturde y silencia a tus enemigos."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wes_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wes_magma"
msgid "A passion for justice fuels the fire within this blouse."
msgstr "Una pasión por la justicia alimenta el fuego de esta blusa."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wes_mandrake
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wes_mandrake"
msgid "A Hallowed Nights costume fashioned after a delightfully annoying vegetable."
msgstr "Un disfraz de Hallowed diseñado a partir de un vegetal deliciosamente molesto."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wes_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wes_nature"
msgid "These artist's tools are mostly for show. It's not easy to get ahold of paints in the wilderness."
msgstr "Las herramientas de este artista son sobre todo para exhibirse. No es fácil obtener pinturas en la naturaleza."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wes_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wes_rose"
msgid "No outfit is too loud when you're a rosy-cheeked mime."
msgstr "Ningún atuendo es demasiado alto cuando eres un mimo de mejillas sonrosadas."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wes_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wes_shadow"
msgid "Dark clothes for cool people."
msgstr "Ropa oscura para gente guay."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wes_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wes_survivor"
msgid "If these clothes could talk just imagine the stories they would tell."
msgstr "Si esta ropa pudiera hablar imagina las historias que contaría."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wes_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wes_victorian"
msgid "It's a good bet that the owner of these clothes spent significant time in a chimney."
msgstr "Es más que evidente que el dueño esta ropa pasa mucho tiempo en una chimenea."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wes_wrestler
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wes_wrestler"
msgid "A ravishing one-piece to make you dazzle!"
msgstr "¡Un deslumbrante conjunto que te hará brillar!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wickerbottom_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wickerbottom_formal"
msgid "Be the life of the party in this gray silk ball gown."
msgstr "Sé el alma de la fiesta con este vestido de seda gris."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wickerbottom_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wickerbottom_gladiator"
msgid "Bend the metallic elements to your will in this sleek purple robe."
msgstr "Luce esta túnica púrpura y elegante mientras doblas los elementos metálicos a tu voluntad."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wickerbottom_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wickerbottom_ice"
msgid "An elegant dress to wear while keeping the common folk at arm's length."
msgstr "Un vestido elegante que puedes usar mientras mantienes a raya a la gente común."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wickerbottom_lightninggoat
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wickerbottom_lightninggoat"
msgid "This electrifying costume will let your dress up like a cute Volt Goat!"
msgstr "¡Con este traje electrizante podrás vestirte como una bonita cabra eléctrica!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wickerbottom_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wickerbottom_magma"
msgid "Dress for the occasion when scrutinizing lava flows in the field."
msgstr "Vístete para la ocasión cuando observes los ríos de lava."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wickerbottom_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wickerbottom_rose"
msgid "All the culture and elegance of an Old Garden rose."
msgstr "Toda la cultura y la elegancia de un jardín de rosas antiguo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wickerbottom_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wickerbottom_shadow"
msgid "This dress is made from many shadow fragments sewn together."
msgstr "Este vestido está hecho de muchos fragmentos de sombra cosidos entre sí."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wickerbottom_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wickerbottom_survivor"
msgid "Living outdoors may be healthy, but it's sure hard on your clothing."
msgstr "Vivir al aire libre puede ser sano, pero es duro con ropa."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wickerbottom_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wickerbottom_victorian"
msgid "The perfect outfit for lounging in the drawing room, or putting the upper crust in their place."
msgstr "El atuendo perfecto para descansar en la sala de estar o poner a la aristocracia en su lugar."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_willow_dowdy
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_willow_dowdy"
msgid "You have more important things to worry about than your appearance."
msgstr "Tienes cosas más importantes de las que preocuparte que tu apariencia."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_willow_dragonfly
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_willow_dragonfly"
msgid "Be a terrifying Dragonfly for Hallowed Nights!"
msgstr "¡Sé una aterradora mosca dragón para Hallowed!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_willow_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_willow_formal"
msgid "Everybody needs a little black dress. (Conveniently, it hides ash stains.)"
msgstr "Todo el mundo necesita un vestido negro. (Convenientemente, oculta las manchas de ceniza)."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_willow_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_willow_gladiator"
msgid "This battle tunic screams \"warrior chic\"."
msgstr "Esta túnica de batalla grita \"guerrero a la moda\" a los cuatro vientos."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_willow_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_willow_ice"
msgid "Much like coldfire itself, this cape and frock shalln't warm their wearer."
msgstr "Así como el fuego frío, esta capa y hábito no le darán calor a quien los use."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_willow_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_willow_magma"
msgid "A frock with the power to appease the Fire Gods."
msgstr "Una vestimenta con el poder de apaciguar a los dioses del fuego."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_willow_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_willow_rose"
msgid "Momentarily slake your thirst for fire and brimstone by wrapping yourself in a lovely frock."
msgstr "Sacia momentáneamente tu sed de fuego y azufre envolviéndote en un hermoso vestido."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_willow_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_willow_shadow"
msgid "This dress flickers as if it were on fire... If that fire were made of shadows."
msgstr "Este vestido titila como si estuviera ardiendo... Aunque ese fuego esté hecho de sombras."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_willow_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_willow_survivor"
msgid "These clothes aren't good for anything except fueling a fire."
msgstr "Esta ropa no sirve para nada excepto para alimentar un fuego."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_willow_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_willow_victorian"
msgid "These rags keep most of the cold out on those bitter nights in the rookeries."
msgstr "Estos harapos protegen bastante del frío en las noches gélidas en los suburbios."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wilson_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wilson_formal"
msgid "Some events ask for white tie, and some ask for black tie. Well, this is red tie."
msgstr "Algunas ocasiones requieren una corbata blanca, y algunas una corbata negra. Bueno, esta es una corbata roja."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wilson_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wilson_gladiator"
msgid "Trimmed with the fur of felled quarry."
msgstr "Recortado y confeccionado con el pelaje de las canteras minadas."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wilson_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wilson_ice"
msgid "This frosted tunic smells like fresh snow."
msgstr "Esta túnica escarchada huele a nieve fresca."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wilson_madscientist
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wilson_madscientist"
msgid "A lab coat for doing science in. Keeps the stains off your clothes."
msgstr "Una bata de laboratorio para hacer cosas científicas. Así no te manchas."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wilson_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wilson_magma"
msgid "Wear this decorative armor while carrying out your obsidious plans."
msgstr "Lleva esta armadura decorativa mientras lleves a cabo tus ardientes planes."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wilson_pigguard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wilson_pigguard"
msgid "Dress up like an intimidating Pig Guard for Hallowed Nights!"
msgstr "¡Vístete como un intimidante cerdo guardián para Hallowed!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wilson_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wilson_rose"
msgid "Rose cultivation is truly a most delicate science."
msgstr "El cultivo de rosas es verdaderamente una ciencia muy delicada."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wilson_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wilson_shadow"
msgid "A suit made of shadows. Quite the opposite of flashy."
msgstr "Un traje hecho con sombras. Lo contrario a llamativo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wilson_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wilson_survivor"
msgid "This outfit may have been attacked by weevils. Or something worse."
msgstr "Este traje puede que haya sido atacado por gorgojos. O algo peor."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wilson_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wilson_victorian"
msgid "Have you tried amputating what ails you?"
msgstr "¿Has probado a amputar lo que te duele?"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_factory
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_factory"
msgid "Winona's uniform from her short-lived stint at the Voxola factory."
msgstr "El uniforme de Winona de su corto periodo en la fábrica de Voxola."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_formal"
msgid "A formal blazer and matching skirt for a sensible party gal."
msgstr "Una chaqueta formal y falda a juego para una chica sensata."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_formalp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_formalp"
msgid "A formal blazer and matching skirt for a sensible party gal."
msgstr "Una chaqueta formal y falda a juego para una chica sensata."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_gladiator"
msgid "An apron to wear to the sweltering fires of The Forge."
msgstr "Un delantal que puedes usar para trabajar con los fuegos sofocantes de la Forja."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_grassgecko
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_grassgecko"
msgid "Dress up like a cute Grass Gekko for Hallowed Nights."
msgstr "Vístete como un bonito gekko de hierba para Hallowed."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_magma"
msgid "Multipurpose armor that also works as welding gear."
msgstr "Una armadura multiusos que también sirve de equipo de soldadura."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_nature"
msgid "This delightful frock is cool and comfortable, perfect for an afternoon of gardening."
msgstr "Este delicioso vestido es fresco y cómodo, perfecto para una tarde de jardinería."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_rose"
msgid "Wild roses don't claim hillsides by being delicate."
msgstr "Las rosas silvestres no reclaman las laderas por ser delicadas."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_rosep
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_rosep"
msgid "Wild roses don't claim hillsides by being delicate."
msgstr "Las rosas silvestres no reclaman las laderas por ser delicadas."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_shadow"
msgid "Blood is thicker than water. Oil is thicker than both."
msgstr "La sangre es más espesa que el agua. El aceite es más espeso que ambas."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_shadowp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_shadowp"
msgid "Blood is thicker than water. Oil is thicker than both."
msgstr "La sangre es más espesa que el agua. El aceite es más espeso que ambas."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_survivor"
msgid "You're just about overall this wilderness survival."
msgstr "Vas a hacer un gran trabajo en estas tierras salvajes."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_survivorp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_survivorp"
msgid "You're just about overall this wilderness survival."
msgstr "Vas a hacer un gran trabajo en estas tierras salvajes."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_winona_victorian"
msgid "Keep oil and automaton grease off your clothing with this fine leather apron."
msgstr "Mantén lejos el aceite y la grasa de autómata de tu ropa con este delantal de cuero fino."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wolfgang_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wolfgang_formal"
msgid "Formal dinner attire for military officers."
msgstr "Atuendo para cenas formales para oficiales militares."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wolfgang_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wolfgang_gladiator"
msgid "Bare your mighty muscles and let your foes know what they're up against."
msgstr "Saca a relucir tus músculos y deja que tus enemigos sepan a quién se enfrentan."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wolfgang_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wolfgang_ice"
msgid "The robe of a man who embodies the spirit of giving."
msgstr "La túnica de un hombre que personifica el espíritu de la generosidad."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wolfgang_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wolfgang_magma"
msgid "Incinerate your competition with the strength of an inferno."
msgstr "Incinera a tus competidores con la fuerza de un infierno."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wolfgang_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wolfgang_rose"
msgid "When the muscle is stripped away all that remains is a sweet, delicate flower."
msgstr "Cuando el músculo está despojado de todo queda una flor dulce y delicada."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wolfgang_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wolfgang_shadow"
msgid "These clothes put hair on your chest."
msgstr "Esta ropa te pone pelo en el pecho."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wolfgang_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wolfgang_survivor"
msgid "Wearing fur makes you feel like mighty animal!"
msgstr "¡Llevar pieles te hará sentir como un animal poderoso!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wolfgang_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wolfgang_victorian"
msgid "For when you've a match scheduled naught an hour after high tea."
msgstr "Para cuando tienes un combate programado justo después de la hora del té."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wolfgang_walrus
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wolfgang_walrus"
msgid "Dress up as an old MacTusk for Hallowed Nights!"
msgstr "¡Vístete como un viejo MacOlmillos para Hallowed!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wolfgang_wrestler
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wolfgang_wrestler"
msgid "A wrestling singlet fit for a giant strongman."
msgstr "Una camiseta de lucha libre apta para un fortachón gigante."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_woodie_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_woodie_formal"
msgid "A real Canadian Jacket, made for real Canadians. (Not out of real Canadians.)"
msgstr "Una verdadera chaqueta canadiense, hecha para verdaderos canadienses. (No de verdaderos canadienses)."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_woodie_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_woodie_gladiator"
msgid "Let everyone know you're ready for a brawl with this harness."
msgstr "Usa este arnés para que todos sepan que estás listo para la pelea."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_woodie_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_woodie_magma"
msgid "Sport a hot new look in this cool jacket and T-shirt combo."
msgstr "Disfruta de un nuevo look con esta fantástica chaqueta y camiseta combinadas."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_woodie_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_woodie_nature"
msgid "Tincap not included."
msgstr "Gorra no incluida."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_woodie_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_woodie_rose"
msgid "Wildrose, grow wild and free."
msgstr "Las rosas silvestres crecen salvajes y libres."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_woodie_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_woodie_shadow"
msgid "Clothes for leaping from tree to tree and eating buttered scones."
msgstr "Ropa para saltar de árbol en árbol y comer bollos de mantequilla."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_woodie_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_woodie_survivor"
msgid "Trees are great, but clothing doesn't grow on them."
msgstr "Los árboles son geniales, pero no crece ropa en ellos."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_woodie_treeguard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_woodie_treeguard"
msgid "This Treeguard Hallowed Nights costume will really grow on you."
msgstr "Este disfraz de árbol guardián de Hallowed te acabará encantando."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_woodie_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_woodie_victorian"
msgid "A gentleman's overcoat embellished with fine, rare furs."
msgstr "El abrigo de un caballero adornado con pieles finas y raras."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wortox_minotaur
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wortox_minotaur"
msgid "The torso of a clever and fearsome minotaur."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wortox_original
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wortox_original"
msgid "Complete with cozy neck fur!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wortox_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wortox_survivor"
msgid "One doesn't survive in the forest this long without picking up a few tricks."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wx78_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wx78_formal"
msgid "But of course it has a cummerbund."
msgstr "Pero por supuesto tiene un fajín."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wx78_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wx78_gladiator"
msgid "Make sure your minions know who's top robot."
msgstr "Asegúrate de que tus esbirros sepan quién es el robot que manda."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wx78_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wx78_magma"
msgid "Stoke the fires of this furnace carapace."
msgstr "Apaga el fuego de este caparazón ardiente."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wx78_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wx78_nature"
msgid "This chassis is all bark and no byte."
msgstr "Este chasis es muy ladrador y poco mordedor."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wx78_rhinorook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wx78_rhinorook"
msgid "This Rook Hallowed Nights costume will give you a run for your money."
msgstr "Este disfraz de torre de Hallowed será todo un triunfo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wx78_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wx78_rose"
msgid "Vines wrapped around wires, wires wrapped around vines."
msgstr "Viñas enredadas en cables, cables enredados en viñas."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wx78_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wx78_shadow"
msgid "A dark automaton chassis with a lovely decorative gemstone."
msgstr "Un chasis de autómata oscuro con una hermosa piedra decorativa."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wx78_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wx78_survivor"
msgid "It may have seen better days, but this body is still minimally functional."
msgstr "Puede que haya visto mejores días, pero este cuerpo es aún mínimamente funcional."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wx78_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wx78_victorian"
msgid "It seems this elaborate diving suit was constructed with artistic taste in mind. It has no functional purpose."
msgstr "Parece que este elaborado traje de buceo fue construido con gusto artístico en mente. No tiene ningún propósito funcional."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wx78_wip
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_wx78_wip"
msgid "A partially constructed robot body. You can see the gears inside."
msgstr "Un cuerpo de robot construido parcialmente. Puedes ver los engranajes."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_yule_coat
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_yule_coat"
msgid "Put another log on the fire! No, seriously, it's about to go out."
msgstr "¡Echa más leña al fuego! De verdad, está a punto de apagarse."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_yule_dress
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_yule_dress"
msgid "A dashing frock for dashing through the snow!"
msgstr "¡Un atuendo elegante para correr por la nieve!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_yuled_coat
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_yuled_coat"
msgid "Put another log on the fire! No, seriously, it's about to go out."
msgstr "¡Echa más leña al fuego! De verdad, está a punto de apagarse."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_yuled_dress
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_yuled_dress"
msgid "A dashing frock for dashing through the snow!"
msgstr "¡Un atuendo elegante para correr por la nieve!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.book_brimstone_gilded
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.book_brimstone_gilded"
msgid "The lettering inside is exquisitely calligraphed."
msgstr "Las letras del contenido son de una caligrafía exquisita."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.bugnet_spider
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.bugnet_spider"
msgid "This lil guy can't get enough! Don't worry though, he'll share everything he catches with you."
msgstr "¡Este chico no se cansa! Pero no te preocupes, compartirá todo lo que pille contigo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.cane_ancient
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.cane_ancient"
msgid "To tread ancient paths, long forgotten."
msgstr "Para andar por caminos antiguos olvidados hace mucho tiempo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.cane_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.cane_victorian"
msgid "A cane to accompany you on your afternoon stroll."
msgstr "Un bastón para acompañarte en tu paseo por la tarde."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.catcoonhat_trapper_rooster
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.catcoonhat_trapper_rooster"
msgid "This trapper hat is soft and cozy, but the ends don't seem to tie up anymore."
msgstr "Este gorro ruso es suave y cómodo, pero sus extremos parece que ya no se atan más."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.catcoonhat_trapperup_rooster
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.catcoonhat_trapperup_rooster"
msgid "This trapper hat appears to have been permanently tied up. Luckily it looks stylish that way."
msgstr "Este gorro ruso parece que no se puede desatar. Por suerte, parece que tiene estilo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.cookpot_cauldron
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.cookpot_cauldron"
msgid "Double, double, broil and gobble, campfire burns and crockpot bubbles!"
msgstr "Ojos de sapo, patas de rana, ¡que tengas suerte toda la semana!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.cookpot_survival
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.cookpot_survival"
msgid "This cooking pot looks kind of beaten up, but the food it cooks still tastes delicious."
msgstr "Esta olla parece un poco maltrecha, pero la comida que cocina sigue sabiendo deliciosa."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.cookpot_tureen
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.cookpot_tureen"
msgid "This crockpot is shaped like an elegant Victorian tureen."
msgstr "Esta vasija tiene forma de una elegante sopera victoriana."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.dragonling_bat
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.dragonling_bat"
msgid "You'd have to be blind not to appreciate this bat's horrifying adorableness."
msgstr "Tendrías que estar ciego para no apreciar la horrible adorabilidad de este murciélago."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.dragonling_bat_builder
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.dragonling_bat_builder"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.dragonling_winter
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.dragonling_winter"
msgid "This Broodling renounced its fiery ways... Now it's a lovely shade of blue!"
msgstr "Esta cría de mosca dragón ha renunciado a su estilo ardiente... ¡Ahora es de un precioso tono azul!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.dragonling_winter_builder
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.dragonling_winter_builder"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.dragonling_wyvern
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.dragonling_wyvern"
msgid "This pet's doofy lil dragon face inspires both fear and wuv."
msgstr "Esta mascota extraña con carita de dragón inspira miedo y ternura."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.dragonling_wyvern_builder
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.dragonling_wyvern_builder"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_abigail
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_abigail"
msgid "Add a dash of color to the conversation.\n\nType :abigail: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Añade un toque de color a la conversación.\n\nEscribe :abigail: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_alchemyengine
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_alchemyengine"
msgid "Add a little science to everyone's day.\n\nType :alchemyengine: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Añade un poco de ciencia a la vida de todos.\n\nEscribe :alchemyengine: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_arcane
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_arcane"
msgid "Make chatting a little more magical.\n\nType :arcane: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Dale un toque mágico al chat.\n\nEscribe :arcane: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_backpack
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_backpack"
msgid "If there's one thing you can do with this backpack, it's carry a conversation.\n\nType :backpack: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Si hay algo que puedes hacer con esta mochila, es llevar una conversación.\n\nEscribe :backpack: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_battle
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_battle"
msgid "Let everyone know you're ready for a fight with this battle emoticon.\n\nType :battle: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Que todos sepan que estás listo para luchar con este emoticono de batalla.\n\nEscribe :battle: en el chat para usarlo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_beefalo
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_beefalo"
msgid "A cute beefalo face brightens any conversation.\n\nType :beefalo: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "La carita preciosa de un beefalo alegra cualquier conversación.\n\nEscribe :beefalo: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_beehive
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_beehive"
msgid "Let everyone in chat know that you're a busy bee.\n\nType :beehive: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Enseña a todo el mundo en el chat que eres una abeja obrera.\n\nEscribe :beehive: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_berry_bush
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_berry_bush"
msgid "Pick and choose your topics of conversation.\n\nType :berry_bush: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Escoge y recoge tus temas de conversación.\n\nEscribe :berry_bush: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_carrot
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_carrot"
msgid "Ehh, what's up, chat?\n\nType :carrot: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "¿Qué pasa, amigos?\n\nEscribe :carrot: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_chest
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_chest"
msgid "For conversations where you need to get something off your chest.\n\nType :chest: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Para esas charlas que sirven para desahogarse.\n\nEscribe :chest: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_chester
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_chester"
msgid "A loyal friend makes a great addition to any chat.\n\nType :chester: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Un amigo fiel que aporta muchísimo al chat.\n\nEscribe :chester: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_crockpot
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_crockpot"
msgid "Use this emoticon to let others know what's for dinner.\n\nType :crockpot: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Usa este emoticono para que los demás se enteren de la comida deliciosa que estás por engullir.\n\nEscribe :crockpot: en el chat para usarlo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_egg
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_egg"
msgid "Make sure all your chat jokes go over easy.\n\nType :egg: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Asegúrate de que todos tus chistes en el chat salen bien.\n\nEscribe :egg: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_eyeball
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_eyeball"
msgid "Keep an eye on chat with this eyeball emoticon.\n\nType :eyeball: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "No pierdas al chat de vista con este emoticono.\n\nEscribe :eyeball: en el chat para usarlo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_eyeplant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_eyeplant"
msgid "What're you looking at, chat?\n\nType :eyeplant: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "¿Qué miras? ¿Quieres charlar?\n\nEscribe :eyeplant: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_faketeeth
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_faketeeth"
msgid "Some people are just chatterboxes.\n\nType :faketeeth: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Algunas personas no pueden dejar de hablar.\n\nEscribe :faketeeth: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_farm
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_farm"
msgid "This farm emoticon is sure to cultivate excellent conversation.\n\nType :farm: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Este emoticono de una granja te vendrá bien para cultivar una excelente conversación.\n\nEscribe :farm: en el chat para usarlo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_fire
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_fire"
msgid "Ignite conversation with this fire emoticon.\n\nType :fire: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Enciende la llama de la conversación con este emoticono.\n\nEscribe :fire: en el chat para usarlo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_firepit
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_firepit"
msgid "Keep conversations burning late into the night with this firepit emoticon.\n\nType :firepit: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Mantén viva la llama de las conversaciones hasta entrada la noche con este emoticono de hoguera.\n\nEscribe :firepit: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_flex
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_flex"
msgid "Make sure others witness your strong conversational skills.\n\nType :flex: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Asegúrate que los demás son testigos de tus gran don de palabra.\n\nEscribe :flex: para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_ghost
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_ghost"
msgid "Bring a touch of the supernatural to chat.\n\nType :ghost: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Dale un toque sobrenatural al chat.\n\nEscribe :ghost: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_gold
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_gold"
msgid "Sometimes you just have to drop a nugget of truth into the conversation.\n\nType :gold: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "A veces tienes que soltar una pepita de sabiduría en la conversación.\n\nEscribe :gold: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_grave
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_grave"
msgid "This emoticon is suited to even the gravest of conversation topics.\n\nType :grave: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Este emoticono viene bien para encontrar el equilibrio hasta en los temas de conversación más fuertes.\n\nEscribe :grave: en el chat para usarlo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_hambat
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_hambat"
msgid "Go ham in chat with this ham bat emoticon.\n\nType :hambat: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Aporrea y degusta en el chat con este emoticono de bate de jamón.\n\nEscribe :hambat: en el chat para usarlo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_hammer
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_hammer"
msgid "A hammer chat emoticon is sure to drive any point home.\n\nType :hammer: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Un emoticono de un martillo que puede darle punto final a cualquier discusión.\n\nEscribe :hammer: en el chat para usarlo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_heart
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_heart"
msgid "Show everyone you care with this heart emoticon.\n\nType :heart: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Demuestra tu ternura al mundo con este emoticono de un corazón.\n\nEscribe :heart: en el chat para usarlo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_horn
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_horn"
msgid "Get on the horn with chat.\n\nType :horn: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Coge el toro por los cuernos en el chat.\n\nEscribe :horn: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_hunger
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_hunger"
msgid "Let your friends in chat know you're feeling a bit peckish.\n\nType :hunger: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Dile a tus amigos en el chat que tienes un poco de hambre con esto.\n\nEscribe :hunger: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_lightbulb
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_lightbulb"
msgid "Illuminate conversations with this lightbulb emoticon.\n\nType :lightbulb: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Arroja algo de luz a la conversación con este emoticono de una bombilla.\n\nEscribe :lightbulb: en el chat para usarlo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_meat_big
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_meat_big"
msgid "Put a big ol' hunk of meat in chat. Why not?\n\nType :meat_big: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Pon un buen trozo de comida en el chat. ¿Por qué no?\n\nEscribe :meat_big: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_pig
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_pig"
msgid "Chatting's never a boar with this pigman emoticon.\n\nType :pig: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "El chat no estaría completo sin este emoticono de un cerdo.\n\nEscribe :pig: en el chat para usarlo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_poop
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_poop"
msgid "Some emotions are simply best expressed through manure.\n\nType :poop: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Algunas emociones se transmiten mejor con algo de estiércol.\n\nEscribe :poop: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_redgem
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_redgem"
msgid "Let someone know you think they're a gem.\n\nType :redgem: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Hazle saber a alguien que es un gema preciosa.\n\nEscribe :redgem: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_refine
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_refine"
msgid "Let someone know their comment was a gem.\n\nType :refine: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Di a alguien que su comentario fue una joya.\n\nEscribe :refine: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_salt
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_salt"
msgid "Bring just a pinch of salt to chat.\n\nType :salt: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Échale una pizca de sal al chat.\n\nEscribe :salt: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_sanity
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_sanity"
msgid "It'd be insane not to use this brain emoticon in chat.\n\nType :sanity: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Sería una locura no usar este emoticono de un cerebro en el chat.\n\nEscribe :sanity: en el chat para usarlo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_sciencemachine
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_sciencemachine"
msgid "Let everyone in chat know it's time for science.\n\nType :sciencemachine: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Dile a todos en el chat que llegó la hora de la ciencia.\n\nEscribe :sciencemachine: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_shadowmanipulator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_shadowmanipulator"
msgid "Give the conversation a hint of magic.\n\nType :shadowmanipulator: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Dale a la conversación un toque de magia.\n\nEscribe :shadowmanipulator: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_shovel
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_shovel"
msgid "Some topics of conversation are best buried.\n\nType :shovel: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Algunos temas de conversación es mejor dejarlos enterrados.\n\nEscribe :shovel: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_skull
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_skull"
msgid "Abandon all hope ye who enter chat.\n\nType :skull: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Abandonen toda esperanza aquellos que entren al chat.\n\nEscribe :skull: para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_thumbsup
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_thumbsup"
msgid "Use this thumbs up emoticon to let everyone know that you approve.\n\nType :thumbsup: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Usa el icono del pulgar en el chat para que todo el mundo sepa que das tu aprobación.\n\nEscribe :thumbsup: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_tophat
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_tophat"
msgid "Class up any conversation with this top hat emoticon.\n\nType :tophat: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Agrégale un poco de clase a cualquier conversación con este emoticono de una chistera.\n\nEscribe :tophat: en el chat para usarlo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_torch
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_torch"
msgid "For illuminating conversation.\n\nType :torch: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Para iluminar la conversación.\n\nEscribe :torch: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_trap
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_trap"
msgid "Lure others into conversation with this trap emoticon.\n\nType :trap: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Atrae a los demás a la conversación con este emoticono de trampa.\n\nEscribe :trap: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_trophy
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_trophy"
msgid "Let everyone know they did great with this trophy emoticon.\n\nType :trophy: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Di a los demás que lo hicieron genial con este emoticono de trofeo.\n\nEscribe :trophy: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_wave
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_wave"
msgid "Say \"hi\" to chat with this wave emoticon!\n\nType :wave: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "¡Di \"hola\" con este emoticono de saludo!\n\nEscribe :wave: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_web
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_web"
msgid "Get tangled up in conversation with this spider web emoticon.\n\nType :web: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Enrédate en la conversación con este emoticono de una telaraña.\n\nEscribe :web: en el chat para usarlo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_wormhole
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emoji_wormhole"
msgid "A wormhole emoticon, for quick escape from awkward conversations.\n\nType :wormhole: in chat to use this emoticon."
msgstr "Un emoticono de agujero de gusano, para escapar rápidamente de conversaciones extrañas.\n\nEscribe :wormhole: en el chat para usar este emoticono."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_carol
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_carol"
msgid "Type /carol to sing a Winter's Feast carol."
msgstr "Escribe /carol para cantar el villancico de la Fiesta Invernal."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_dance_chicken
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_dance_chicken"
msgid "Type /chicken to do a chicken dance!"
msgstr "¡Escribe /chicken para bailar el baile de la gallina!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_dance_robot
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_dance_robot"
msgid "Type /robot to do the robot!"
msgstr "¡Escribe /robot para hacer el paso del robot!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_dance_step
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_dance_step"
msgid "Type /step to perform a step dance."
msgstr "Escribe /step para hacer un paso de baile."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_fistshake
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_fistshake"
msgid "Type /fistshake to show your frustration."
msgstr "Escribe /fistshake para demostrar tu frustración."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_flex
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_flex"
msgid "Type /flex to flex your muscle!"
msgstr "¡Escribe /flex para flexionar los músculos!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_impatient
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_impatient"
msgid "Type /impatient to tap your foot impatiently."
msgstr "Escribe /impatient para que tu pie denote impaciencia."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_jumpcheer
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_jumpcheer"
msgid "Type /cheer to do a big cheer!"
msgstr "¡Escribe /cheer para soltar un grito de alegría!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_laugh
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_laugh"
msgid "Type /laugh to laugh."
msgstr "Escribe /laugh para reírte."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_shrug
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_shrug"
msgid "Type /shrug to shrug. Meh."
msgstr "Escribe /shrug para encogerte de hombros."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_sleepy
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_sleepy"
msgid "Type /sleepy to rub your groggy eyes."
msgstr "Escribe /sleepy para frotarte los ojos cansados."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_slowclap
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_slowclap"
msgid "Type /slowclap to express your disapproval."
msgstr "Escribe /slowclap para expresar tu descontento."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_swoon
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_swoon"
msgid "Type /swoon to fall into a deep swoon."
msgstr "Escribe /swoon para caer en un profundo desmayo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_yawn
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.emote_yawn"
msgid "Type /yawn to let everyone know you're ready for an adorable nap!"
msgstr "¡Escribe /yawn para que todos sepan que estás listo para una buena siesta!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.endtable_carpet
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.endtable_carpet"
msgid "A table that would be a truly elegant addition to any unkempt wilderness base."
msgstr "Una mesa que sería un complemento realmente elegante en cualquier base descuidada en la naturaleza."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.endtable_dragonfly
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.endtable_dragonfly"
msgid "An endtable inspired by the most opulent of bloodthirsty monsters."
msgstr "Una mesa inspirada en el monstruo sediento de sangre más opulento."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.endtable_vintage
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.endtable_vintage"
msgid "A quaint decorative table that would make your grandmother proud."
msgstr "Una pintoresca mesa decorativa que enorgullecería a tu abuela."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.featherhat_circus
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.featherhat_circus"
msgid "Enter the ring."
msgstr "Entra en la pista."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_bootie_black_scribble
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_bootie_black_scribble"
msgid "A pair of 'scribble black' colored boot devices."
msgstr "Un par de botas de color \"negro garabato\"."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_bunnyslippers_purple_mauve
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_bunnyslippers_purple_mauve"
msgid "Show those bunnies what's what by wearing this pair of fuzzy 'snail mucus purple' colored bunny slippers."
msgstr "Enseña a esos conejitos cuántas son cinco llevando este par de zapatillas de conejo de color \"morado mucosidad de caracol\"."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_fleece_boot_brown_sepia
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_fleece_boot_brown_sepia"
msgid "Infused with maple syrup and essence of moose. This pair is a tasteful 'werebeaver brown' color."
msgstr "Bañadas con jarabe de arce y esencia de alce. Este par es un color \"marrón hombre castor\" de buen gusto."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_formal_highheel_white_pure
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_formal_highheel_white_pure"
msgid "Dress to the nines in these 'pure white' colored shoes."
msgstr "Vístete de punta en blanco con estos zapatos de color \"blanco puro\"."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_formal_lowheel_black_scribble
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_formal_lowheel_black_scribble"
msgid "Low-heeled 'scribble black' colored dress shoes."
msgstr "Zapatos para vestir con tacones bajos de color \"negro garabato\"."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_formal_stiletto_black_scribble
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_formal_stiletto_black_scribble"
msgid "High-heeled 'scribble black' colored dress shoes."
msgstr "Zapatos para vestir con tacones altos de color \"negro garabato\"."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_fuzzyslippers_blue_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_fuzzyslippers_blue_ice"
msgid "Warm, fuzzy, 'anthropomorphic feline blue' colored slippers. A spot of cheer in a hostile world."
msgstr "Zapatillas calentitas y peludas de color \"azul felino antropomorfo\". Un poco de alegría en un mundo hostil."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_maryjanes_white_pure
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_maryjanes_white_pure"
msgid "Hit the jackpot with these classic 'pure white' colored Mary Janes."
msgstr "Triunfa con estos Mary Janes clásicos de color \"blanco puro\"."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_ridingboot_white_pure
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_ridingboot_white_pure"
msgid "A pair of 'pure white' colored riding boots. Yee-haw!"
msgstr "Un par de botas de montar de color \"blanco puro\". ¡Yi-ja!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_sandals_blue_catcoon
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_sandals_blue_catcoon"
msgid "A pair of 'catcoon blue' colored sandals, with socks (for extra fashion)."
msgstr "Un par de sandalias color \"azul gapache\" con calcetines (para estar más a la moda)."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_slippers_rooster_white_pure
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_slippers_rooster_white_pure"
msgid "Slip your feet into some fluffy, comfy chicken slippers."
msgstr "Prueba estas zapatillas de gallo, mullidas y cómodas."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_sneakers_blue_catcoon
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_sneakers_blue_catcoon"
msgid "Wear these 'catcoon blue' colored sneakers surreptitiously."
msgstr "Lleva estas zapatillas de color \"azul gapache\" subrepticiamente."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_sneakers_green_cactus
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_sneakers_green_cactus"
msgid "Wear these 'cactus green' colored sneakers surreptitiously."
msgstr "Lleva estas zapatillas de color \"verde cactus\" subrepticiamente."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_sneakers_orange_carrot
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_sneakers_orange_carrot"
msgid "Wear these 'carrot orange' colored sneakers surreptitiously."
msgstr "Lleva estas zapatillas de color \"naranja zanahoria\" subrepticiamente."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_sneakers_red_auburn
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_sneakers_red_auburn"
msgid "Wear these 'low pH red' colored sneakers surreptitiously."
msgstr "Lleva estas zapatillas de color \"rojo pH bajo\" subrepticiamente."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wathgrithr_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wathgrithr_gladiator"
msgid "A pair of battlemaster's sandals to wear into the arena."
msgstr "Un par de sandalias de maestro de batalla para usar en la arena."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wathgrithr_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wathgrithr_nature"
msgid "It feels as though the owner of these sandals would rather run barefoot."
msgstr "Es como si el dueño de estas sandalias prefiriera correr descalzo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wathgrithr_wrestler
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wathgrithr_wrestler"
msgid "These wrestling boots give you the best performance."
msgstr "Con estas botas de lucha tendrás el mejor rendimiento."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_waxwell_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_waxwell_gladiator"
msgid "Powerful spells are best followed by a click of the heels."
msgstr "Los conjuros poderosos surten un mejor efecto si son seguidos de un choque de tacones."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_waxwell_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_waxwell_nature"
msgid "Ground yourself by feeling the earth beneath your feet."
msgstr "Cálmate sintiendo la tierra debajo de tus pies."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_webber_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_webber_gladiator"
msgid "Freshly sharpened spider toesies, ready for a fight."
msgstr "Deditos de araña recién afilados listos para luchar."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_webber_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_webber_ice"
msgid "A fuzzy pair of wintry snow slippers."
msgstr "Un par de pantuflas de nieve invernales y mullidas."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_webber_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_webber_magma"
msgid "Hot-foot it into the ring."
msgstr "Corre sobre el fuego y lucha."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_webber_punk
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_webber_punk"
msgid "Arachnid combat boots."
msgstr "Botas de combate arácnidas."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_webber_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_webber_victorian"
msgid "Don't forget your slate on the way to the schoolhouse."
msgstr "No te olvides la pizarra cuando vayas al colegio."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wendy_creepy
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wendy_creepy"
msgid "Supernatural footwear."
msgstr "Calzado sobrenatural."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wendy_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wendy_gladiator"
msgid "A pair of fur-trimmed sandals for a usurper to wear."
msgstr "Un par de sandalias con toques de pelo para que una usurpadora las use."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wendy_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wendy_ice"
msgid "A lovely pair of traditional winter boots."
msgstr "Un par encantador de botas de invierno tradicionales."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wendy_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wendy_magma"
msgid "Tip-toe across the ashes you rose from."
msgstr "Pisa de puntillas las cenizas de las que te has levantado."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wendy_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wendy_victorian"
msgid "Heavy shoes to tread the path of sorrow."
msgstr "Unos zapatos pesados para andar por el sendero del dolor."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wes_clown
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wes_clown"
msgid "Schadenfreuded shoes."
msgstr "Zapatos de regodeo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wes_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wes_gladiator"
msgid "A breathable pair of duelist's sandals to wear into the ring."
msgstr "Un par de sandalias de duelista y transpirables para usar en el combate."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wes_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wes_magma"
msgid "Fine footwear for delivering flaming justice."
msgstr "Un bonito calzado para impartir justicia ardiente."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wes_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wes_nature"
msgid "The paint is never going to come out of these shoes."
msgstr "La pintura nunca se quitará de estos zapatos."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wes_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wes_victorian"
msgid "Black shoes don't show the soot."
msgstr "Con los zapatos negros no se ve el hollín."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wickerbottom_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wickerbottom_gladiator"
msgid "Sandals with leather tops to prevent accidental spilling of metallurgist's concoctions."
msgstr "Sandalias con partes de cuero para prevenir el derrame de brebajes metalúrgicos sobre los pies."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wickerbottom_ice1
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wickerbottom_ice1"
msgid "White heels, each adorned with a piercing ice crystal."
msgstr "Zapatos de tacón blancos adornados con un cristal de hielo perforador."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wickerbottom_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wickerbottom_magma"
msgid "Gold tipped lava leapers."
msgstr "Botas de lava con punta de oro."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wickerbottom_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wickerbottom_victorian"
msgid "Fashionably heeled shoes for a woman of high society."
msgstr "Zapatos de tacón modernos para una mujer de la alta sociedad."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_willow_dowdy
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_willow_dowdy"
msgid "A homely way to seize."
msgstr "Una forma hogareña de ir."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_willow_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_willow_gladiator"
msgid "Thick straps make these fur-trimmed sandals sturdy and comfortable."
msgstr "Unos tirantes gruesos hacen de estas sandalias con toques de pelo un calzado recio y cómodo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_willow_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_willow_ice"
msgid "A pair of stylish heels accented by a puff of rabbit fur."
msgstr "Un par de distinguidos zapatos de tacón adornados con el rabito de un conejo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_willow_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_willow_victorian"
msgid "The cold of the cobblestones seeps right through them."
msgstr "El frío de los adoquines se filtra a través de ellos."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wilson_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wilson_gladiator"
msgid "You were born to battle. You feel it in your soles."
msgstr "Has nacido para la batalla. Lo sientes en tus suelas."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wilson_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wilson_ice"
msgid "Pointy shoes for a frigid fellow."
msgstr "Zapatos puntiagudos para alguien de carácter frío."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wilson_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wilson_victorian"
msgid "Shoes that have tread on many a spilled concoction."
msgstr "Unos zapatos que han pisado muchos brebajes derramados."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_winona_factory
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_winona_factory"
msgid "Sturdy workboots courtesy of the Voxola Radio Company."
msgstr "Unas botas resistentes cortesía de la compañía de radio Voxola."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_winona_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_winona_gladiator"
msgid "Nothing beats a pair of brass-toed boots."
msgstr "Nada supera a un par de botas con puntas de latón."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_winona_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_winona_nature"
msgid "Maybe wipe these boots off before you walk on the clean floors."
msgstr "Tal vez es mejor que seques las botas antes de andar en suelos limpios."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wolfgang_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wolfgang_gladiator"
msgid "Even berserkers like having warm feet."
msgstr "Hasta los más violentos gustan de tener sus pies calentitos."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wolfgang_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wolfgang_ice"
msgid "A handsome pair of traditional winter boots."
msgstr "Un par espléndido de botas de invierno tradicionales."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_woodie_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_woodie_gladiator"
msgid "A sensible pair of boots to keep you on balance in the ring."
msgstr "Un par de botas adecuadas para mantener el equilibrio en el combate."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_woodie_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_woodie_nature"
msgid "They smell faintly of apples."
msgstr "Huelen débilmente a manzanas."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_workboot_brown_chocolate
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_workboot_brown_chocolate"
msgid "These 'insufficient chocolate brown' colored boots will protect you from stubbing your toes, but not a whole lot else."
msgstr "Estas botas de color \"marrón chocolate insuficiente\" te protegerán de tropezarte, pero no mucho más."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_workboot_tan_clay
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_workboot_tan_clay"
msgid "These 'muddy shoes tan' colored boots will protect you from stubbing your toes, but not a whole lot else."
msgstr "Estas botas de color \"bronceado zapatos embarrados\" te protegerán de tropezarte, pero no mucho más."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wx78_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wx78_gladiator"
msgid "These boots were made for crushing, and that's just what they'll do."
msgstr "Estas botas fueron hechas para aplastar, y aplastar es lo que hacen."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wx78_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wx78_magma"
msgid "For iron puddling jumping."
msgstr "Para andar con pies de plomo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wx78_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wx78_nature"
msgid "Reject hi-tech sorcery and return to your technological roots."
msgstr "Rechaza la hechicería de alta tecnología y regresa a tus raíces tecnológicas."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wx78_wip
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.feet_wx78_wip"
msgid "Archaic foundational apparatuses."
msgstr "Aparatos fundacionales arcaicos."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.fence_factory
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.fence_factory"
msgid "This fence is made of metal piping for that chic \"industrial\" look."
msgstr "Esta valla está hecha de tuberías de metal para ese look \"industrial\" chic."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.fence_factory_item
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.fence_factory_item"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firepit_fanged
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firepit_fanged"
msgid "Thish firepit ish made of rocksh that reshemble fangsh. What would it shay if it could shpeak?"
msgstr "Eshhhta hoguera eshhhtá hecha de rocasshh que parecen colmillossshh. ¿Qué diría sshhhi pudiessshe hablar?"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firepit_firebird
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firepit_firebird"
msgid "This fire pit is adorned by several lovely stone wings."
msgstr "Este foso de fuego está adornado por varias hermosas alas de piedra."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firepit_hole
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firepit_hole"
msgid "Bottomless pits are the best. But bottomless pits filled with fire are even better."
msgstr "Los pozos sin fondo son los mejores. Pero los pozos sin fondo llenos de fuego son aún mejores."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firepit_stonehenge
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firepit_stonehenge"
msgid "A firepit modeled after an ancient, giant monument. Luckily, this version is sized more appropriately for humans (and human-sized entities)."
msgstr "Una hoguera modelada a partir de un monumento antiguo y gigante. Por suerte, esta versión tiene un tamaño más apropiado para los humanos (y para entes de tamaño humano)."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firepit_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firepit_victorian"
msgid "The heart of every household."
msgstr "El corazón de cada hogar."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firestaff_bee
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firestaff_bee"
msgid "firestaff_bee"
msgstr "firestaff_bee"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firestaff_gungnir
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firestaff_gungnir"
msgid "firestaff_gungnir"
msgstr "firestaff_gungnir"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firestaff_lance
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firestaff_lance"
msgid "firestaff_lance"
msgstr "firestaff_lance"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firestaff_meteor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firestaff_meteor"
msgid "This fire staff is strangely reminiscent of the Infernal Staff found in The Forge."
msgstr "Este báculo de fuego infernal se parece mucho al báculo infernal que encontraste en la Forja."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firestaff_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firestaff_rose"
msgid "firestaff_rose"
msgstr "firestaff_rose"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firesuppressor_circus
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.firesuppressor_circus"
msgid "Look and be amazed by the incredible automatic snowball juggling machine!"
msgstr "¡Contempla y asómbrate con la increíble máquina de malabares de bolas de nieve automática!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.flowerhat_crown
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.flowerhat_crown"
msgid "This feather hat is so luxurious to the touch!"
msgstr "¡Este sombrero de plumas es un lujo que se aprecia incluso desde lejos!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.flowerhat_healing
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.flowerhat_healing"
msgid "This lovely wreath of Life Blossoms have lost their magic, but they still look divine."
msgstr "Esta corona de flores de la vida perdió su magia, pero sigue estando igual de bonita."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.flowerhat_holly_wreath
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.flowerhat_holly_wreath"
msgid "A jolly holly laurel to wear on your head. How winter-y!"
msgstr "Un laurel navideño para llevarlo en la cabeza. ¡Tan invernal!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.flowerhat_ribbon_wreath
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.flowerhat_ribbon_wreath"
msgid "Get in the seasonal spirit by wreathing your head in lovely ribbons!"
msgstr "¡Empápate del espíritu festivo poniéndote unas bonitas cintas en la cabeza!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.flowerhat_wreath
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.flowerhat_wreath"
msgid "Laurels ought rest on you, not the other way around."
msgstr "No te duermas en los laureles, úsalos en la cabeza."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.footballhat_combathelm
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.footballhat_combathelm"
msgid "Who wouldn't be intimidated by this fearsome helm?"
msgstr "¿Quién no se sentiría intimidado por este yelmo?"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.footballhat_combathelm2
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.footballhat_combathelm2"
msgid "Behold its terrifying curly horns!"
msgstr "¡Contempla sus aterradores cuernos enroscados!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.glomling_beardeddragon
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.glomling_beardeddragon"
msgid "A pet as noble as he is huggable."
msgstr "Un animal tan noble como abrazable."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.glomling_beardeddragon_builder
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.glomling_beardeddragon_builder"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.glomling_winter
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.glomling_winter"
msgid "What a precious little snowball you are, Glomglom!"
msgstr "¡Qué preciosa bolita de nieve, glomglom!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.glomling_winter_builder
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.glomling_winter_builder"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hambat_potroast
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hambat_potroast"
msgid "Delicious, delicious murder."
msgstr "Asesinato delicioso, delicioso."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hambat_spiralcut
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hambat_spiralcut"
msgid "This ham bat was fashioned after the scepter of the great Battlemaster Pugna."
msgstr "La inspiración para crear este bate de jamón surgió del cetro del gran maestro de batalla Pugna."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hammer_crowbar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hammer_crowbar"
msgid "A mighty man hammers with a crowbar."
msgstr "Un hombre poderoso golpea con una palanca."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hammer_forge
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hammer_forge"
msgid "Watch out for the spikey bits."
msgstr "Cuidado con los picos."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_beltedgloves_brown_beaver
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_beltedgloves_brown_beaver"
msgid "'Werebeaver brown' colored gloves with a buckle on the back to help you hold it together."
msgstr "Estos guantes de color \"marrón hombre castor\" con una hebilla atrás te ayudarán a tenerlo todo bien atado."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_beltedgloves_red_firehound
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_beltedgloves_red_firehound"
msgid "'Firehound red' colored gloves with a buckle on the back to help you hold it together."
msgstr "Estos guantes de color \"rojo sabueso de fuego\" con una hebilla atrás te ayudarán a tenerlo todo bien atado."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_beltedgloves_teal_jungle
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_beltedgloves_teal_jungle"
msgid "'Jungle green' colored gloves with a buckle on the back to help you hold it together."
msgstr "Estos guantes de color \"verde jungla\" con una hebilla atrás te ayudarán a tenerlo todo bien atado."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_drivergloves_white_ivory
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_drivergloves_white_ivory"
msgid "These 'houndbone white' colored gloves are worn by good looking people who look cool."
msgstr "Estos guantes de color \"blanco hueso de perro\" los llevan la gente guapa que viste guay."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_longgloves_green_hunters
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_longgloves_green_hunters"
msgid "'Forest guardian green' colored gloves suitable for all types of persons, robots, and monsters."
msgstr "Guantes de color \"verde guardabosques\" adecuados para todo tipo de personas, robots y monstruos."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_longgloves_grey_battleship
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_longgloves_grey_battleship"
msgid "'Cumulus gray' colored gloves suitable for all types of persons, robots, and monsters."
msgstr "Guantes de color \"gris cúmulos\" adecuados para todo tipo de personas, robots y monstruos."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_longgloves_white_pure
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_longgloves_white_pure"
msgid "'Pure white' colored gloves suitable for all types of persons, robots, and monsters."
msgstr "Guantes de color \"blanco puro\" adecuados para todo tipo de personas, robots y monstruos."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_longgloves_yellow_straw
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_longgloves_yellow_straw"
msgid "'Sulfuric yellow' colored gloves suitable for all types of persons, robots, and monsters."
msgstr "Guantes de color \"amarillo sulfúrico\" adecuados para todo tipo de personas, robots y monstruos."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_shortgloves_black_scribble
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_shortgloves_black_scribble"
msgid "These are gloves. They cover your hands. This pair is 'scribble black' colored."
msgstr "Unos guantes. Te cubren las manos. Este par es de color \"negro garabato\"."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_shortgloves_blue_cornflower
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_shortgloves_blue_cornflower"
msgid "These are gloves. They cover your hands. This pair is 'rubber glove blue' colored."
msgstr "Unos guantes. Te cubren las manos. Este par es de color \"azul guante de goma\"."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_shortgloves_red_higgsbury
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_shortgloves_red_higgsbury"
msgid "These are gloves. They cover your hands. This pair is 'Higgsbury red' colored."
msgstr "Unos guantes. Te cubren las manos. Este par es de color \"rojo Higgsbury\"."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_shortgloves_white_smoke
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_shortgloves_white_smoke"
msgid "These are gloves. They cover your hands. This pair is 'smoke white' colored."
msgstr "Unos guantes. Te cubren las manos. Este par es de color \"blanco humo\"."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wathgrithr_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wathgrithr_gladiator"
msgid "These fists are ready for glorious battle."
msgstr "Estos puños están listos para buscar la gloria en el combate."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wathgrithr_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wathgrithr_magma"
msgid "Battle gloves to withstand the flames that will consume this world."
msgstr "Unos guantes de batalla para resistir las llamas que consumirán este mundo."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wathgrithr_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wathgrithr_nature"
msgid "These wrist coverings belong to someone who is at home in the woods."
msgstr "Estas cubiertas de muñeca pertenecen a alguien que está como en casa en el bosque."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wathgrithr_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wathgrithr_victorian"
msgid "A pair of thin cloth gloves, likely worn by an actress."
msgstr "Un par de finos guantes de tela, probablemente usados por una actriz."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wathgrithr_wrestler
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wathgrithr_wrestler"
msgid "Hand wraps and padded gloves mean hands are protected for better punches."
msgstr "Con unas envolturas y guantes acolchados las manos estarán protegidas para lograr mejores golpes."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_waxwell_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_waxwell_formal"
msgid "White gloved hands are sometimes a symbol of deception. They're also a symbol of fashion!"
msgstr "Las manos con guantes blancos a veces son un símbolo de engaño. ¡Son también un símbolo de moda!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_waxwell_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_waxwell_gladiator"
msgid "The handwraps of an alchemist, skilled at battle."
msgstr "Los cubremanos de un alquimista hábil para el combate."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_waxwell_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_waxwell_magma"
msgid "Gloves worthy of wrathful combat."
msgstr "Unos guantes para combates feroces."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_waxwell_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_waxwell_nature"
msgid "There's a perpetual dew dotting the leaves on the back of these gloves."
msgstr "Hay un rocío perpetuo que salpica las hojas en la parte posterior de estos guantes."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_waxwell_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_waxwell_victorian"
msgid "A pair of white gloves for a high class snob."
msgstr "Un par de guantes blancos para un snob de clase alta."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_webber_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_webber_gladiator"
msgid "Perhaps after battle you could take up decorative hedge trimming."
msgstr "Quizás podrías ir a clases de decoración de setos después de la batalla."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_webber_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_webber_magma"
msgid "Like little candle flames for your claws."
msgstr "Como pequeñas llamas de vela para tus garras."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_webber_punk
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_webber_punk"
msgid "The spikes on these cuffs look scary, but they're actually quite soft."
msgstr "Los pinchos de esas pulseras dan miedo, pero en realidad son bastante suaves."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_webber_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_webber_victorian"
msgid "A pair of cuffs to wear when studiously practicing the three Rs."
msgstr "Un par de puños para llevar mientras se practican estudiosamente las tres R."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wendy_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wendy_gladiator"
msgid "These handwraps are imbued with a quiet ferocity."
msgstr "Estos cubremanos están imbuidos con una ferocidad tremenda."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wendy_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wendy_ice"
msgid "A thin pair of winter gloves."
msgstr "Un par finito de guantes de invierno."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wendy_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wendy_magma"
msgid "Flaming winged accessories to accompany your rebirth."
msgstr "Accesorios alados ardientes para acompañar tu renacimiento."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wendy_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wendy_victorian"
msgid "Soft gloves to hold your heartbreak."
msgstr "Guantes suaves para contener tu desamor."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wes_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wes_gladiator"
msgid "A light gauntlet design for an expert duelist."
msgstr "Un guantelete de luz diseñado para un duelista experto."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wes_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wes_magma"
msgid "Fancy fingers for fiery fighting."
msgstr "Unos dedos bonitos para una lucha ardiente."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wes_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wes_nature"
msgid "Gloves to paint cheery, small trees in."
msgstr "Unos guantes para pintar alegres y pequeños árboles."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wes_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wes_victorian"
msgid "These were white gloves when you first started in the sweep business."
msgstr "Eran guantes blancos cuando empezaste en el negocio de barrer chimeneas."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wes_wrestler
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wes_wrestler"
msgid "Your challengers can't handle how gorgeous these gloves are."
msgstr "Tus rivales no pueden soportar lo bonitos que son estos guantes."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wickerbottom_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wickerbottom_gladiator"
msgid "A thin strip of cloth to protect your caster's hands."
msgstr "Una tira delgada de tela para proteger las manos del hechicero."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wickerbottom_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wickerbottom_ice"
msgid "Sleek arm covers that radiate cool, clear refinement."
msgstr "Tapabrazos brillantes que irradian un refinamiento claro y fresco."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wickerbottom_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wickerbottom_magma"
msgid "Armored gloves for handling hot magma samples."
msgstr "Unos guantes de armadura para manejar muestras de magma."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wickerbottom_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wickerbottom_victorian"
msgid "You'll be the envy of all at the luncheon in this refined number."
msgstr "Serás la envidia de todos en la comida con esta prenda refinada."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_willow_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_willow_gladiator"
msgid "A fine leather set of bracers to wear into battle."
msgstr "Un conjunto atractivo de brazales de cuero para usar en la batalla."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_willow_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_willow_ice"
msgid "Two small tufts of rabbit fur to adorn the wrists."
msgstr "Dos penachos pequeños de pelo de conejo que adornan las muñecas."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_willow_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_willow_magma"
msgid "Impress a deity with these sacrificial bangles."
msgstr "Impresiona a una deidad con estos brazaletes sacrificiales."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_willow_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_willow_victorian"
msgid "These matchstick seller gloves do little to keep out the cold."
msgstr "Estos guantes de vendedor de cerillas apenas pueden proteger del frío."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wilson_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wilson_formal"
msgid "These gloves will hide the chemical stains on your hands when you dress up for formal occasions."
msgstr "Estos guantes ocultan las manchas químicas de tus manos cuando te vistas para ocasiones formales."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wilson_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wilson_gladiator"
msgid "These bracers will help you look the part in the arena."
msgstr "Estos brazales te ayudan a ponerte a la altura de la arena."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wilson_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wilson_ice"
msgid "The gloves of a fellow with an icy touch."
msgstr "Los guantes de alguien que posee un toque frío."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wilson_madscientist
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wilson_madscientist"
msgid "Laboratory gloves imbued with mercury, to encourage madness. (Don't try this at home.)"
msgstr "Guantes de laboratorio bañados en mercurio para alentar la locura. (No intentes hacer esto en casa.)"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wilson_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wilson_magma"
msgid "Rock hard gloves, sure to intimidate."
msgstr "Unos guantes duros como una piedra que seguro que intimidan."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wilson_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wilson_victorian"
msgid "Don't worry, this won't hurt a bit!"
msgstr "¡No te preocupes, casi no te dolerá!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_winona_factory
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_winona_factory"
msgid "Standard issue Voxola workgloves, so you don't get fingerprints on the merchandise."
msgstr "Guantes de trabajo estándar de Voxola, así que no dejarás tus huellas en la mercancía."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_winona_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_winona_gladiator"
msgid "Any pair of gloves can be improved by brass plating."
msgstr "Cualquier par de guantes luce mejor al colocarle una placa de latón."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_winona_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_winona_magma"
msgid "Perfectly welded welding gloves."
msgstr "Unos guantes de soldadura perfectamente soldados."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_winona_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_winona_nature"
msgid "These once-thick gardening gloves are old and worn. They won't provide much protection anymore."
msgstr "Estos guantes de jardinería, en su día gruesos, ahora están viejos y gastados. Ya no proporcionarán mucha protección."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_winona_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_winona_victorian"
msgid "Thick gloves for transferring smelted metals."
msgstr "Guantes gruesos para transferir metales fundidos."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wolfgang_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wolfgang_gladiator"
msgid "Your mighty fists need no armor, only slight embellishment."
msgstr "Tus puños poderosos no requieren de protección alguna, sino de ornamentación."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wolfgang_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wolfgang_ice"
msgid "These gloves fail to keep the cold out, although they inspire a feeling of coziness."
msgstr "Estos guantes no te protegerán del frío, pero al menos transmiten una sensación acogedora."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wolfgang_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wolfgang_magma"
msgid "Flaming adornments for your wrists."
msgstr "Adornos llameantes para las muñecas."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wolfgang_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wolfgang_victorian"
msgid "Left hook! Right hook! Jab, jab!"
msgstr "¡Gancho de izquierda! ¡Gancho de derecha! ¡Corto, corto!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wolfgang_wrestler
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wolfgang_wrestler"
msgid "Fingerless gloves for delivering the smack down."
msgstr "Guantes sin dedos para derribar al oponente."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_woodie_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_woodie_gladiator"
msgid "These leather gloves have small holes cut in them for the knuckles to show through."
msgstr "Estos guantes de cuero tienen unos agujeros pequeños para que puedan apreciarse los nudillos."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_woodie_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_woodie_magma"
msgid "Studded gloves for peerless gripping of an axe."
msgstr "Unos guantes tachonados para lograr un agarre incomparable del hacha."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_woodie_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_woodie_nature"
msgid "These wrist bands have been delicately woven by deft hands."
msgstr "Estas muñequeras han sido delicadamente tejidas por hábiles manos."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_woodie_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_woodie_victorian"
msgid "Keep your hands free for tanning pelts!"
msgstr "¡Mantén las manos libres para curtir pieles!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wortox_minotaur
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wortox_minotaur"
msgid "A pair of monstrous minotaur claws sporting golden bracers."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wortox_original
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wortox_original"
msgid "The fuzzy paws of a sweet forest fawn."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wortox_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wortox_survivor"
msgid "Sharp goblin claws honed for wilderness survival."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wx78_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wx78_gladiator"
msgid "Make them regret falling into your metallic clutches."
msgstr "Haz que se arrepientan de haber caído en tus garras metálicas."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wx78_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wx78_magma"
msgid "Com-bust some heads in style sporting these Furnace Gloves."
msgstr "Haz que ardan algunas cabezas con estos guantes de horno."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wx78_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wx78_nature"
msgid "Get in touch with nature with these clinging vine hand replacements."
msgstr "Entra en contacto con la naturaleza con estas manos postizas de vid."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wx78_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wx78_victorian"
msgid "These diving suit gloves are old and worn. They probably aren't waterproof anymore."
msgstr "Estos guantes de traje de buceo están viejos y desgastados. Probablemente ya no son impermeables."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wx78_wip
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hand_wx78_wip"
msgid "Just wires and bolts."
msgstr "No son más que cables y tornillos."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hat_catcoon_costume
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hat_catcoon_costume"
msgid "Is that really a cap with a catcoon's face? You've gotta be kitten me!"
msgstr "¿Es eso un gorro con cara de gatopache? ¿O me engatusaron?"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hat_chester_costume
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hat_chester_costume"
msgid "They say that imitation is the sincerest form of flattery."
msgstr "La imitación es la forma más sincera de halago."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hat_dog_helm
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hat_dog_helm"
msgid "BEWARE OF DOG."
msgstr "CUIDADO CON EL PERRO."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hat_glommer_costume
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hat_glommer_costume"
msgid "The goopiness inside the rim makes it glom to your head that much better!"
msgstr "La viscosidad del interior hace que se pegue mejor a la cabeza."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hat_hutch_costume
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hat_hutch_costume"
msgid "It's a Hutch hatch, for your head!"
msgstr "¡Es una conejera, para tu cabeza!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hat_puppy_cap
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.hat_puppy_cap"
msgid "Not made of real puppies."
msgstr "No está hecho con mascotas de verdad."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.icebox_coffin
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.icebox_coffin"
msgid "Send your food to an icy grave."
msgstr "Envía tu comida a una tumba helada."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.icebox_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.icebox_victorian"
msgid "A sophisticated ice box, for the sophisticated wilderness dweller."
msgstr "Una caja de hielo sofisticada, para el habitante en la naturaleza sofisticado."

